@inherits RazorSlice<GroupRouteModel>
@* A route as plain text, one piece per segment (GroupRouteModel). The <wbr> lets a long route wrap between segments, and the pieces stay on the brace line so Razor emits no whitespace. *@
<code class="api-group-route">@foreach (var part in Model.Parts){<wbr>@part}</code>
